## Collision track (30 XP)

### 1. Make cart 1 stop dead after the collision (15 XP)
| Setting | Value |
|---|---|
| Cart 1 | **2 kg, 3 m/s** |
| Cart 2 | **2 kg, 0 m/s** |
| Bounciness | **1 (elastic)** |

*Why:* equal masses in an elastic collision swap velocities, so cart 1 takes cart 2's speed of 0.

### 2. Lose half the kinetic energy, within 2% (15 XP)
| Setting | Value |
|---|---|
| Cart 1 | **2 kg, 3 m/s** |
| Cart 2 | **2 kg, 0 m/s** |
| Bounciness | **0 (sticky)** |

*Why:* the carts stick together and move at 1.5 m/s. KE goes from 9 J to 4.5 J, which is exactly half.

